ate bank data livestreamed in Claude today through Enable Banking. Or just drop the CSV export lmao stop freaking out", "url": "https://x.com/bobaliceHQ/status/2118453326979183009"}, {"author_id": "2115057179514322944", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:14:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118452029299290164"], "id": "2118452029299290164", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118419005568389584", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus All they did was connect Plaid (US bank data provider) to Claude. You can literally do this in EU through open banking MCP", "url": "https://x.com/bobaliceHQ/status/2118452029299290164"}, {"author_id": "149615276", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:08:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118450456099713381"], "id": "2118450456099713381", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 119, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118419005568389584", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus I don’t think this is just EU laws chubby - the US administration also spoke about limiting AI models and functionality to the US first then rolling it out. So it’s red tape on both sides.", "url": "https://x.com/gailcweiner/status/2118450456099713381"}, {"author_id": "2482408872", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:06:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118449873120800770"], "id": "2118449873120800770", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1573399256836309009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 80, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118419005568389584", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kimmonismus Europe is always missing out I swear", "url": "https://x.com/Jtyles/st